Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 12:07:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] diag: add request-vs-db timing instrumentation
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Logs total request time alongside cumulative Prisma query time for every
write (and any request over 500ms), so we can tell whether slow writes
are caused by the database itself or by something else (host CPU,
network, middleware). Also flags any single query over 150ms.

Additive and safe to revert — see comments in requestTiming.js.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GEL1Ys6SnzUAqMHzPVhBk9
